    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Grains close the week soft",
        "body": "- December corn settled at **$4.47¾**, down 3½ cents, and November soybeans added 2½ cents to $12.22¼.\n- Feedstuffs called the week's finish lightly mixed, with corn, soybeans and winter wheat going different ways.\n- Chicago wheat was about unchanged at $6.03½.",
