        "overnight_surprise": false
      },
      {
        "title": "Cattle and hogs slip",
        "body": "- October live cattle settled at $224.00, down 1.4%, and November feeders fell 2.5% to **$337.78**.\n- AgWeb asked whether the cattle drop alongside weaker cash is more than a healthy correction. Nothing in the news answers that yet.\n- December hogs gave back 1.6% to $58.88.",
